  <FLAVOURTEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="en-US"><![CDATA[Akros’s greatest heroes are also its royalty.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="fr-FR"><![CDATA[Les plus grands héros d'Akros sont aussi ses souverains.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="es-ES"><![CDATA[Los mayores héroes de Akros son también su realeza.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="de-DE"><![CDATA[Akros’ berühmteste Helden herrschen über die Polis.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="it-IT"><![CDATA[I più grandi eroi di Akros sono anche i suoi reggenti.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="jp-JA"><![CDATA[アクロスの最も偉大な英雄たちは、その王族でもある。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ko-KR"><![CDATA[아크로스의 최고 영웅은 왕과 왕비다.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ru-RU"><![CDATA[Величайшие герои Акроса — его правители.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="pt-BR"><![CDATA[Os maiores heróis de Acros são, também, sua realeza.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-CN"><![CDATA[阿喀洛斯最伟大的英雄伴侣，也是皇室伉俪。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-HK"><![CDATA[阿喀洛斯最偉大的英雄伴侶，也是皇室伉儷。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
  </FLAVOURTEXT>
